# 🤝 Contributing to Codexeron

Thank you for your interest in contributing to Codexeron.

## Welcome

We appreciate every contribution that helps improve the Codexeron ecosystem.

## Before You Start

Please:

- Read the documentation.
- Search existing issues before creating a new one.
- Keep pull requests focused on a single feature or fix.

## How to Contribute

1. Fork this repository.
2. Create a feature branch.
3. Make your changes.
4. Test your changes.
5. Commit with a clear message.
6. Submit a Pull Request.

## Coding Standards

- Write clean and readable code.
- Follow project conventions.
- Update documentation when needed.

## Questions

If you have questions, visit:

https://www.codexeron.com

Thank you ❤️
